# ── Build JDK override ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Force every Gradle/Maven build (functional tests, JaCoCo, migration) to launch
# with a SPECIFIC local JDK, regardless of any stray older JDKs (e.g. a JDK 8 in
# ~/.jdks). Point this at a JDK 21 install to fix "Unsupported class file major
# version 65" configuration failures. Takes precedence over JAVA_HOME.
# Example (Windows): JAVAAPEX_BUILD_JDK=C:\Users\you\AppData\Local\Programs\Eclipse Adoptium\jdk-21.0.10.7-hotspot
JAVAAPEX_BUILD_JDK=
